# Build artefacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# The build embeds a manifest into the Windows binary; see docs/spec.md SR-7.
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib

# Local overrides. `.cargo/config.toml` at this crate's root is committed on
# purpose (it decides the static CRT); anything else under `.cargo` is local.
.cargo/config.local.toml

# Report archives written at runtime, never committed: they contain host facts
# and evidence taken from a machine that was scanned, which is not ours to publish.
*.irscan-archive.json
archive/
